WEBVTT

00:00.940 --> 00:07.950
Well, is the Young Master finally
going to intervene in this world?

00:07.950 --> 00:08.950
Who knows?

00:10.100 --> 00:10.910
I think...

00:11.310 --> 00:14.890
...he is unaware of how powerful
he is at this point.

00:15.750 --> 00:18.920
I wouldn't be surprised
if he took action in the first place.

00:19.540 --> 00:23.090
The Young Master upholds values
and has experience from the past.

00:23.090 --> 00:24.770
Values?

00:25.670 --> 00:26.380
So?

00:27.380 --> 00:29.340
Will he finally undergo some changes?

00:30.010 --> 00:33.090
There hasn't been
any drastic change in his heart.

00:33.090 --> 00:38.430
The Young Master has yet to have found
the role he should play in this world.

00:38.840 --> 00:39.850
Really?

00:39.850 --> 00:41.850
What a shame.

00:41.850 --> 00:45.980
But in terms of strength and power,
he is fully developed.

00:45.980 --> 00:50.200
Even a Greater Dragon such as yourself
could barely leave a scratch on him.

00:52.490 --> 00:53.450
Is that so?

00:53.450 --> 00:55.660
That's how powerful he's become.

00:58.410 --> 01:00.370
He just might be the one...

01:00.870 --> 01:04.370
...to defeat the goddess.

01:18.520 --> 01:23.980
TSUKIMICHI -MOONLIT FANTASY- SEASON 2

02:35.510 --> 02:38.970
NIGHT 18: THE ACADEMY HAS FALLEN

02:40.790 --> 02:41.970
Abelia...

02:41.970 --> 02:44.690
I didn't expect her to defeat Ilumgand.

02:46.600 --> 02:49.650
I failed to save the knight...

02:49.650 --> 02:51.980
and couldn't turn Master Ilumgand
back to normal.

02:51.980 --> 02:53.750
I'm terribly sorry.

02:54.510 --> 02:57.890
Kuzunoha, do not blame yourself.

02:58.490 --> 03:00.830
The students did
a splendid job back there.

03:00.830 --> 03:03.540
I'd love to recruit all of you
to my kingdom.

03:03.960 --> 03:05.770
I'm flattered.

03:06.190 --> 03:07.350
Mr. Kuzunoha.

03:08.080 --> 03:13.210
I want to have a word with you
after the whole commotion is over.

03:13.590 --> 03:15.130
Yes, understood.

03:15.750 --> 03:17.680
Is this about earlier?

03:18.680 --> 03:20.890
Even though I wasn't going to tell anyone.

03:21.680 --> 03:24.030
Please go to safety.

03:24.600 --> 03:28.690
We are going to evacuate the civilians
and must head out now.

03:29.040 --> 03:30.570
Evacuation?

03:30.570 --> 03:32.200
Given how strong you are,

03:32.200 --> 03:34.030
shouldn't you be taking down the monsters?

03:34.450 --> 03:36.280
I'll do that if necessary.

03:36.280 --> 03:38.770
But the academy has combatants
to deal with the monsters.

03:38.770 --> 03:41.740
We should focus on evacuation
and aid instead.

03:42.610 --> 03:46.710
He reminds me of the hero
when she first arrived.

03:47.290 --> 03:50.790
Pardon me, I didn't catch that.

03:50.790 --> 03:52.500
It's nothing.

03:53.000 --> 03:54.010
Joshua.

03:54.010 --> 03:54.590
Yes.

03:54.590 --> 03:57.430
Order the troops standing by
within our borders...

03:57.430 --> 03:59.170
to advance on Rotsgard now.

03:59.170 --> 04:03.390
Tell the operators in between to report back to
the kingdom via telepathy as soon as possible.

04:03.390 --> 04:04.310
Understood.

04:04.890 --> 04:07.730
The nearest troop is in our
kingdom's southern region,

04:07.730 --> 04:09.520
in the Hopleys' domain.

04:12.610 --> 04:15.030
Kuzunoha, please commence the teleportation.

04:15.820 --> 04:17.740
Assist the Hopleys.

04:18.280 --> 04:19.740
Understood.

04:25.580 --> 04:27.540
Young Master!

04:27.540 --> 04:29.750
Are you all right?

04:29.750 --> 04:30.630
Yeah.

04:30.630 --> 04:33.380
But it seems things got hairy
on your side.

04:36.090 --> 04:37.720
It will be fully healed soon.

04:37.720 --> 04:39.550
There won't be any scarring.

04:39.870 --> 04:41.510
Ye... Yes!

04:41.850 --> 04:44.510
She put a full-blown spell on her arrow.

04:44.510 --> 04:46.390
That was a reckless move.

04:46.910 --> 04:48.730
She was lucky to have pulled that off.

04:49.730 --> 04:51.060
Sir...

04:51.400 --> 04:52.940
Jin, well done.

04:53.360 --> 04:56.550
I didn't care one bit about that guy.

04:57.070 --> 04:58.930
I was even angry at him.

04:59.530 --> 05:01.660
But I couldn't bring myself to kill him.

05:02.160 --> 05:04.380
Because he was a human,
not an average monster.

05:04.380 --> 05:05.830
It's natural to feel that way.

05:06.190 --> 05:09.270
I wanted to turn him back
to normal if possible.

05:09.910 --> 05:11.540
Was that thought too naive?

05:11.880 --> 05:13.880
If you think the naivety
was a weakness,

05:13.880 --> 05:16.730
use your remaining time
at school to improve.

05:17.340 --> 05:20.010
But personally,
I think that is your virtue.

05:20.510 --> 05:24.260
The naivety that put everyone else's life
in danger was a virtue?

05:24.260 --> 05:25.470
I can't...

05:25.890 --> 05:28.310
Anyway, rest well for now.

05:28.310 --> 05:29.850
We received reports of...

05:29.850 --> 05:33.440
numerous mutants terrorizing
the town and the nearby cities.

05:33.770 --> 05:35.770
There are monsters in our town too?

05:35.770 --> 05:38.440
But how? What happened?

05:38.780 --> 05:40.190
Let us join the fight.

05:40.510 --> 05:42.530
You are still students.

05:42.530 --> 05:44.930
Someone else can
take care of the fighting.

05:44.930 --> 05:45.620
Now,

05:46.120 --> 05:47.140
you two...

05:48.200 --> 05:49.640
Your parents are safe.

05:49.640 --> 05:51.580
My trustworthy guards
are keeping them safe.

05:51.580 --> 05:53.210
There's nothing to worry about.

05:53.210 --> 05:54.830
Will you do as I say and evacuate?

05:55.210 --> 05:56.930
Yes.

05:56.930 --> 05:59.800
We'll find shelter for now.

06:05.030 --> 06:08.300
They are still excited
from the fight earlier.

06:08.300 --> 06:11.640
The King of Limia's honorable invite
will have to wait for another time.

06:14.230 --> 06:17.190
Lead the students to safety.

06:17.190 --> 06:19.150
Keep watch for a day.

06:20.740 --> 06:22.860
Young Master, where are you going?

06:23.490 --> 06:25.820
To check the situation on the streets.

06:26.320 --> 06:27.740
It's not safe over there!

06:27.740 --> 06:28.780
Go to safety!

06:28.780 --> 06:29.830
Run!

06:33.370 --> 06:36.340
My... My shop...

06:37.670 --> 06:41.210
The merchandise and our stockpile
were brought back to the Subspace.

06:41.210 --> 06:43.550
The sign was put away, but...

06:45.010 --> 06:45.890
This is sad.

06:46.260 --> 06:49.680
Should I take this as a sign
to start anew?

06:50.140 --> 06:52.850
Without positive thinking,
I'll end up moping forever.

06:55.520 --> 06:56.560
That voice...

06:56.930 --> 06:59.020
- It's from the red-light district.
- No!

06:59.730 --> 07:01.190
Help!

07:04.070 --> 07:05.400
Stop!

07:11.330 --> 07:13.290
Is that... an octopus?

07:15.620 --> 07:18.710
A giant mollusk attacking the courtesans?

07:19.130 --> 07:20.460
This is insane.

07:21.300 --> 07:22.920
I'll take care of this creature.

07:22.920 --> 07:24.350
Please head outside.

07:24.350 --> 07:26.010
I'll take you to safety afterward...

07:27.760 --> 07:29.770
I don't know where to look.

07:29.770 --> 07:32.060
Get the girls out of here.

07:32.060 --> 07:33.850
I'll deal with this thing.

07:33.850 --> 07:36.190
I may not look like one,
but I was an adventurer.

07:36.560 --> 07:38.850
I am a part-time lecturer at the academy.

07:38.850 --> 07:40.690
I'll regroup with you later.

07:40.690 --> 07:42.780
A lecturer? From the academy?

07:47.530 --> 07:48.570
How awful.

07:49.410 --> 07:50.620
Please leave.

07:50.620 --> 07:51.240
If you can,

07:51.240 --> 07:53.830
please help evacuate the people
in other buildings.

07:54.540 --> 07:55.750
Got it.

07:55.750 --> 07:57.160
Don't die, Teacher.

07:57.540 --> 07:58.540
All right, let's go!

07:58.540 --> 07:59.130
Get moving!

07:59.130 --> 07:59.750
Yes!

08:00.170 --> 08:01.340
I'm so nervous.

08:01.340 --> 08:03.840
I'm not used to seeing
women dressed that way.

08:04.200 --> 08:07.930
The ladies in this area always bought
energy drinks from our shop.

08:07.930 --> 08:10.800
I must protect my precious customers.

08:11.890 --> 08:13.010
Blitz!

08:15.180 --> 08:16.680
Suppression.

08:29.820 --> 08:30.780
That doesn't look good.

08:39.420 --> 08:41.630
Hey! Are you all right?

08:43.920 --> 08:46.300
Yeah. I took down that monster.

08:46.300 --> 08:49.260
The lecturer didn't disappoint.

08:49.570 --> 08:51.970
Are these all the people you evacuated?

08:52.300 --> 08:53.300
Yes.

08:53.300 --> 08:55.310
Where is the shelter you're sending us to?

08:55.310 --> 08:58.680
The nearest one from here
is the slum.

08:58.680 --> 08:59.690
The slum?

08:59.690 --> 09:01.690
The slum with a lot of demi-humans?

09:02.060 --> 09:05.480
Fortunately,
their leader is an acquaintance.

09:05.480 --> 09:08.740
It's someone I met
through my business.

09:09.530 --> 09:12.200
Are you from the Kuzunoha Company?

09:12.200 --> 09:14.410
Yes.
I am the spokesperson, Kuzunoha.

09:15.330 --> 09:17.160
So, you're the guy.

09:17.160 --> 09:20.290
My girls often go to your shop
for drinks that relieve fatigue.

09:20.790 --> 09:23.720
Thanks for the patronage.

09:25.710 --> 09:27.920
You're a weird person.

09:27.920 --> 09:29.720
To avoid any trouble
when we get there,

09:29.720 --> 09:31.300
I'll convince the girls.

09:31.300 --> 09:32.550
Thanks a lot.

09:32.550 --> 09:35.220
The whole commotion will end eventually.

09:35.220 --> 09:37.260
Please hang on until then.

09:37.580 --> 09:39.810
Sorry for the trouble.

09:39.810 --> 09:42.390
It's a bit late for an introduction,
but I am Ester.

09:42.390 --> 09:43.230
Nice to meet you.

09:43.570 --> 09:45.840
Pleasure meeting you.
I am Kuzunoha.

09:47.780 --> 09:49.860
The student shelter isn't far from here.

09:49.860 --> 09:51.860
Please take a good rest.

09:52.320 --> 09:53.280
Yes.

09:53.280 --> 09:54.820
Got it.

09:57.540 --> 09:58.740
Lady Mio?

09:58.740 --> 10:01.120
Shiki, go on without me.

10:01.120 --> 10:03.080
Are you going somewhere?

10:03.080 --> 10:05.330
There's a matter I must tend to.

10:06.250 --> 10:07.270
Very well.

10:07.720 --> 10:09.800
Please meet up with us
as soon as possible.

10:13.630 --> 10:15.070
Well then...

10:21.680 --> 10:24.730
I'm an expert when it comes
to regeneration,

10:24.730 --> 10:25.930
so I can sense it.

10:26.900 --> 10:29.570
Is it the scent or just the aura?

10:29.570 --> 10:30.610
There are some signs.

10:31.570 --> 10:34.770
The core has been obliterated.

10:34.770 --> 10:36.070
Poor thing.

10:36.990 --> 10:38.830
I remember you.

10:38.830 --> 10:42.040
Are you Kuzunoha's woman?

10:42.450 --> 10:45.290
Oh my, you can actually speak.

10:45.290 --> 10:48.000
I'm surprised you still have
a consciousness.

10:49.090 --> 10:52.970
I am Ilumgand Hopleys.

10:53.260 --> 10:55.680
You were.

10:56.090 --> 11:00.350
I was controlled by the wicked
and turned into a monster.

11:00.350 --> 11:01.970
Even so, I lost the battle.

11:04.270 --> 11:05.850
How humiliating.

11:05.850 --> 11:07.790
Indeed. This is humiliating.

11:07.790 --> 11:10.670
Up until just now, I had the urge
to destroy everything in sight.

11:10.670 --> 11:13.070
I felt frustrated by my emotions.

11:13.070 --> 11:15.650
But now, everything is so peaceful,
as if nothing happened.

11:16.010 --> 11:17.700
Of course.

11:17.700 --> 11:21.660
You are now nothing more than
a chunk of meat with memories.

11:22.370 --> 11:24.040
It doesn't matter.

11:24.040 --> 11:26.000
Whatever form I take,

11:26.000 --> 11:28.290
at least I can express my thoughts.

11:29.460 --> 11:31.090
You need not worry.

11:31.090 --> 11:33.380
I will not go after
the Five Irons and Luria.

11:33.690 --> 11:35.930
The Five Irons? Luria?

11:36.470 --> 11:37.830
I don't know why,

11:38.470 --> 11:40.890
but despite the fact that
I cared so much about her,

11:40.890 --> 11:43.560
my desire to realize my dream...

11:43.560 --> 11:46.350
is much stronger
than my yearning for her.

11:47.020 --> 11:49.410
With a set of full-body armor,

11:49.410 --> 11:51.240
I can conceal this body.

11:51.730 --> 11:55.820
I can no longer walk in the sunlight
to pursue my ambition and ideals.

11:57.070 --> 12:01.200
But I want to be Lady Hibiki's shield.

12:01.700 --> 12:04.410
Hibiki? Did I hear that right?

12:05.370 --> 12:09.060
Yes, the hero who was summoned to Limia.

12:09.580 --> 12:12.500
What? You're talking about a hero?

12:12.500 --> 12:15.380
That's not the girl I know.

12:18.800 --> 12:21.470
I feel bad for the little girl.

12:21.470 --> 12:24.390
She is so weak, yet she shares
the same name with a hero.

12:25.100 --> 12:27.150
As long as Lady Hibiki lives,

12:27.150 --> 12:29.690
the demons can be defeated.

12:29.690 --> 12:33.110
She will bring peace
to the human world.

12:35.030 --> 12:37.150
You still retain your memory.

12:37.150 --> 12:38.610
That's a blessing in disguise.

12:39.530 --> 12:41.200
Now I have reason to punish you.

12:44.160 --> 12:45.790
What did you do?

12:46.330 --> 12:49.160
You heard me.
This is your punishment.

12:51.330 --> 12:55.170
I have no intention
to harm any further.

12:55.450 --> 12:56.340
So?

12:57.170 --> 12:59.840
You caused the Young Master
a lot of trouble.

12:59.840 --> 13:01.890
You even disrespected him.

13:01.890 --> 13:04.180
You haven't paid for these sins.

13:04.180 --> 13:05.850
Sins?

13:05.850 --> 13:09.690
I have no means
to make amends in this form.

13:10.040 --> 13:11.560
You can pay with your life.

13:13.520 --> 13:16.070
It's far from enough,

13:16.070 --> 13:17.970
but at least I can forgive you.

13:18.740 --> 13:21.910
Perish along with your unfulfilled wish.

13:25.580 --> 13:26.080
Oh my.

13:26.820 --> 13:29.670
I was going to finish you off in one hit.

13:29.670 --> 13:32.210
But you actually have resistance
against the dark element.

13:32.210 --> 13:33.290
What a surprise.

13:33.290 --> 13:38.510
Does Kuzunoha hate me this much?

13:38.920 --> 13:40.760
The Young Master?

13:42.430 --> 13:45.720
You're adorable when you're being foolish.

13:47.040 --> 13:48.640
To the Young Master,

13:48.640 --> 13:52.190
you're nothing but a pebble
he happens to kick.

13:53.310 --> 13:55.980
So why are you...

14:02.490 --> 14:06.370
Because I can't forgive you.

14:14.290 --> 14:18.510
So far, the confirmed number
of mutants is around 80.

14:19.250 --> 14:21.790
The teleportation arrays
were destroyed one after another.

14:21.790 --> 14:24.380
The communication network
can't operate as usual.

14:24.760 --> 14:27.850
We lost contact with the nearby cities.

14:27.850 --> 14:29.680
Unless we stay really close to each other,

14:29.680 --> 14:32.100
there's no way to talk
via telepathy in this town.

14:32.480 --> 14:36.060
The traffic is in total shambles.

14:36.060 --> 14:40.570
The mutants are blocking
the paths out of this town.

14:40.900 --> 14:43.340
We're completely isolated
from the rest of the world.

14:45.410 --> 14:47.280
That can't be good.

14:47.280 --> 14:50.600
But we still have enough food
for the time being.

14:52.200 --> 14:55.330
Our communication
is jammed by this magic item.

14:55.960 --> 14:59.550
A large number of these devices
were placed inside and outside the town.

14:59.890 --> 15:02.590
Did the demons go out of
their way to hide these?

15:02.590 --> 15:06.260
We couldn't detect them
until they were activated.

15:06.260 --> 15:07.630
Sorry.

15:08.180 --> 15:12.270
However, only humans have trouble
communicating via telepathy.

15:12.270 --> 15:14.980
We don't have that kind of problem.

15:15.600 --> 15:20.650
Only because the form of telepathy we use
is based on the demons' telepathy.

15:20.650 --> 15:24.440
Which means they can still communicate
under these circumstances.

15:24.820 --> 15:27.240
They thought of everything in advance.

15:27.700 --> 15:30.950
The academy has put
the remaining Purple Coats...

15:30.950 --> 15:33.500
together with some lecturers
to form a combat team.

15:33.500 --> 15:36.170
They are operating
under the academy's order.

15:36.540 --> 15:40.670
The other nations will likely start
sending backups and troops.

15:40.670 --> 15:43.890
We should start acting as well.

15:43.890 --> 15:46.680
It's unwise to let them steal
the credit from us.

15:47.470 --> 15:50.890
They know you can teleport, right?

15:50.890 --> 15:53.060
Did no one ask for your help?

15:53.060 --> 15:54.120
They did.

15:54.120 --> 15:58.150
They requested that I help them
transport supplies and soldiers.

15:58.600 --> 16:00.980
I told them there was
a use limit on this sword...

16:00.980 --> 16:03.860
that using it forcibly would break it.

16:04.360 --> 16:06.950
Then, they stopped coming to me.

16:06.950 --> 16:07.780
I see.

16:07.780 --> 16:11.030
Is that why you told them
the power came from that sword?

16:11.030 --> 16:11.830
Correct.

16:11.830 --> 16:14.580
Luto and I improvised
and came up with this idea.

16:15.120 --> 16:19.790
The bad news is that more
mutants are showing up.

16:19.790 --> 16:23.210
I heard there were even mutants
among the refugees.

16:23.510 --> 16:25.090
A considerable amount of people...

16:25.090 --> 16:29.010
received medicine and ornaments
from the demons.

16:29.010 --> 16:30.090
We must track down...

16:30.090 --> 16:34.430
the ornaments that are the same
as that necklace Ilumgand wore.

16:34.430 --> 16:37.180
We confiscate them
and quarantine the owner.

16:37.530 --> 16:38.850
About that...

16:38.850 --> 16:41.940
It seems connected to
the human experiment we discovered.

16:43.090 --> 16:48.070
Mutants recovered as samples
and demi-humans used as test subjects...

16:48.070 --> 16:52.120
tested positive for the same drug.

16:52.410 --> 16:53.410
In other words,

16:53.410 --> 16:55.790
the whole thing could be linked
to the organization...

16:55.790 --> 16:57.580
the demons and Mr. Blight were in.

16:57.580 --> 17:00.370
I'm still unsure about that.

17:00.370 --> 17:02.460
But it's confirmed they are deep...

17:02.460 --> 17:05.880
within the academy's structure
and are well-prepared.

17:07.840 --> 17:10.840
But what are the demons trying
to achieve by sending mutants...

17:10.840 --> 17:12.510
to attack a school?

17:13.260 --> 17:16.430
Are they only trying
to throw Rotsgard into chaos?

17:16.430 --> 17:19.230
Do they have another reason
to stir up trouble here?

17:20.440 --> 17:24.060
If that's the case,
what are they after?

17:28.900 --> 17:29.990
Ms. Bor.

17:30.610 --> 17:31.820
Mr. Kuzunoha.

17:32.450 --> 17:34.620
It's quiet today.

17:34.620 --> 17:36.540
Not much commotion going on.

17:36.920 --> 17:38.160
Great.

17:38.160 --> 17:41.250
There are fewer conflicts
with the humans now.

17:41.830 --> 17:45.250
Nothing concerning.

17:45.250 --> 17:47.960
But it's still dangerous to be outside.

17:48.330 --> 17:51.010
Sorry for making you worry.

17:51.010 --> 17:52.720
But this is a great opportunity...

17:52.720 --> 17:56.010
for the local humans to re-evaluate
their relationship with your kind.

17:56.010 --> 17:57.310
In that case,

17:57.310 --> 18:01.710
this trying time will leave us with more than
just traumatizing moments.

18:02.890 --> 18:04.270
Wonderful.

18:04.270 --> 18:07.670
Cats are wonderful.

18:13.360 --> 18:15.570
Good morning, Young Master.

18:15.570 --> 18:18.290
I don't sense any mutants nearby.

18:18.950 --> 18:20.330
Well done.

18:20.330 --> 18:23.080
I'm meeting up
with the defense force today.

18:23.080 --> 18:24.500
Finally.

18:24.500 --> 18:26.000
I can't wait to join the fun.

18:26.500 --> 18:27.690
I'm counting on you.

18:27.690 --> 18:29.920
Contact me via telepathy
if anything comes up.

18:29.920 --> 18:30.960
Yes.

18:32.060 --> 18:33.530
Mr. Kuzunoha.

18:34.970 --> 18:37.140
Good morning, Ms. Ester.

18:37.510 --> 18:40.220
That's a rigid way to greet someone.

18:40.220 --> 18:42.520
Don't get so formal with me.

18:42.830 --> 18:45.270
Sorry, that's just who I am.

18:45.270 --> 18:46.870
Unbelievable.

18:46.870 --> 18:48.020
Are you going out today?

18:48.330 --> 18:49.230
Yes.

18:49.230 --> 18:51.230
The situation in the slum
is under control.

18:51.230 --> 18:53.030
I want to see how the streets are faring.

18:53.360 --> 18:54.530
I see.

18:54.530 --> 18:56.320
After the whole thing is over,

18:56.320 --> 18:59.160
I'll tell our boss about your good deeds.

18:59.160 --> 19:01.240
That should help your
business in some way.

19:01.540 --> 19:04.030
We are just a small company.
I feel bad about asking,

19:04.030 --> 19:05.710
but please introduce me to your boss.

19:05.980 --> 19:07.710
Leave it to me.

19:07.710 --> 19:08.420
See you around.

19:11.130 --> 19:13.470
The boss of a brothel?

19:13.470 --> 19:15.300
Could it be a mafia?

19:20.930 --> 19:22.810
Evacuate the people?

19:22.810 --> 19:25.770
You are supposed to follow my orders!

19:26.230 --> 19:29.190
We completely lost contact
with two nearby cities.

19:29.190 --> 19:31.270
We still don't know
how all of this happened.

19:31.270 --> 19:32.320
Listen closely.

19:32.320 --> 19:36.320
This is the worst crisis
the academy has ever faced!

19:36.320 --> 19:38.620
And now... How dare you...

19:38.620 --> 19:42.000
What is he expecting
from a lowly part-time lecturer?

19:42.000 --> 19:43.720
This old geezer is unbelievable.

19:43.720 --> 19:45.030
Headmaster.

19:46.370 --> 19:47.620
Princess Lily.

19:47.920 --> 19:53.270
They not only escorted us to safety
but took great risks coming back here.

19:53.270 --> 19:55.340
Please don't be too harsh on them.

19:55.670 --> 20:00.300
Our top priority is to ask for
his help to end this chaos.

20:00.660 --> 20:02.680
Even you, Lady Sairitsu?

20:02.680 --> 20:04.680
I understand.

20:04.680 --> 20:07.850
However, as the leader of this academy...

20:07.850 --> 20:11.230
For our sake, grant him some leeway.

20:12.060 --> 20:14.730
Since both of you put it that way...

20:15.490 --> 20:16.530
Kuzunoha!

20:16.530 --> 20:17.150
Yes.

20:17.610 --> 20:21.030
You are in charge of taking down
the mutants in the northeastern district.

20:21.030 --> 20:24.290
You are permitted to deploy your
company staff and the students.

20:24.290 --> 20:26.200
Restore our reputation!

20:27.960 --> 20:30.170
You really saved me back there.

20:30.170 --> 20:31.420
Thank you so much.

20:31.770 --> 20:33.630
There's no need to thank us.

20:33.630 --> 20:37.430
The hero of the Gritonia Empire
is probably on his way here.

20:37.430 --> 20:39.690
But there's no sign of him
arriving any time soon.

20:39.690 --> 20:41.390
I'm terribly sorry.

20:41.690 --> 20:42.510
Same here.

20:42.510 --> 20:44.850
If the telepathic message
got out on day one,

20:44.850 --> 20:48.520
the dragon riders would already be here
with reinforcements and supplies.

20:48.810 --> 20:50.810
Tomoe's prediction was right.

20:50.810 --> 20:53.360
The other nations
are mobilizing as we speak.

20:54.860 --> 20:55.980
You need not worry.

20:56.530 --> 21:00.110
I will give it my best
to defend this city.

21:00.110 --> 21:01.450
Thank you.

21:02.160 --> 21:06.970
I'd like to have a word with you
before I return to the empire.

21:06.970 --> 21:08.370
After the crisis is dealt with,

21:08.370 --> 21:10.170
could I send my proxy to you?

21:10.580 --> 21:12.000
Of course.

21:12.000 --> 21:15.460
Tomoe and I will go to you.

21:16.920 --> 21:19.260
Sure. I look forward to our meeting.

21:20.380 --> 21:23.800
We even remained calm
when dealing with the headmaster.

21:23.800 --> 21:25.850
Things are off to a great start.

21:27.180 --> 21:29.730
The northeastern district
he's sending me to...

21:29.730 --> 21:31.690
also has a Merchant Guild office.

21:32.270 --> 21:34.610
I hope I don't get any mistreatment there.

21:34.940 --> 21:38.240
Don't be silly.
You'll do just fine, Young Master.

21:38.240 --> 21:42.740
You are amazing despite
your clumsy look.

21:44.030 --> 21:45.950
I have high hopes for you.

21:47.870 --> 21:49.000
Seriously?

21:49.000 --> 21:53.000
I guess Tomoe is too immersed
in her period drama fantasy.

21:53.540 --> 21:55.500
By any means necessary,

21:55.500 --> 21:58.840
I'll make the city remember...

21:58.840 --> 22:01.850
the amazing feat of
the Kuzunoha company.

23:35.190 --> 23:40.020
NEXT EPISODE: THE UNFETTERED MERCHANT
Night 19: "The Unfettered Merchant."
